  intro Ω _ _ W hdim hWt ℓ hℓ A _ _ _ K _ _ _ L _ _ _ _ _ _ 𝔭 t hPD hK hdeg α f hα hf c b υ μ hc hb hb0 hυ hμ h hsmall
